{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drug-fueled hotel massacres with supernatural oversight. Physics-bending highs grant superhuman speed and strength, turning sofas into bone-breakers. Random layouts keep you guessing, stackable mutators amplify the chaos, and brutal finishers make this one bad trip to Vegas.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133310/extras/8ebee1c943890e07efc54b49e928023d.poster.avif?t=1757599506\" width=1170 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133310/extras/8ebee1c943890e07efc54b49e928023d.webm?t=1757599506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133310/extras/8ebee1c943890e07efc54b49e928023d.mp4?t=1757599506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every finisher a brushstroke.</strong> <strong>Every room a spectacle of carnage.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jackal is undoubtedly the most satisfyingly violent and unhinged murder simulator since Hotline Miami.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133310/extras/3c94de68fc4cf1ae4250f5a76a038dcf.poster.avif?t=1757599506\" width=1170 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133310/extras/3c94de68fc4cf1ae4250f5a76a038dcf.webm?t=1757599506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133310/extras/3c94de68fc4cf1ae4250f5a76a038dcf.mp4?t=1757599506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>From sofas to shotguns - everything is lethal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a coked-up John Wick who can turn an entire Vegas hotel into a stage for improvised carnage.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133310/extras/dcfbd5687c77bf3724d902e9f4f9a061.poster.avif?t=1757599506\" width=780 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133310/extras/dcfbd5687c77bf3724d902e9f4f9a061.webm?t=1757599506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133310/extras/dcfbd5687c77bf3724d902e9f4f9a061.mp4?t=1757599506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Rhythmically Pleasant Frantic Violence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With drug-fueled superpowers rooms become physics kill boxes. From tables to kitchen utensils - everything is weaponized.\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133310/extras/6cccf74c377e61e98f7996876f7612a7.poster.avif?t=1757599506\" width=1170 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133310/extras/6cccf74c377e61e98f7996876f7612a7.webm?t=1757599506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133310/extras/6cccf74c377e61e98f7996876f7612a7.mp4?t=1757599506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>No two massacres are alike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each raid is different with randomly generated rooms, unlockable drug superpowers, stackable gameplay mutators, an arsenal of brutal finishers, enemy types, iconic Las Vegas locations, weapons and weaponized items fueling endless creative carnage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133310/extras/b50d8bb7a6201b82c969e64736140093.poster.avif?t=1757599506\" width=1170 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133310/extras/b50d8bb7a6201b82c969e64736140093.webm?t=1757599506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133310/extras/b50d8bb7a6201b82c969e64736140093.mp4?t=1757599506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Tarantino - Hunter Thompson - Palahniuk - Scorsese</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse in a psychedelic noir story where a hitman and his associate navigate a 1970s mob filled Vegas where every housecleaning job bleeds into the next and reality's just another bad trip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133310/extras/2e53c33b91ae57c623d5873d19f6f2fb.poster.avif?t=1757599506\" width=1170 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133310/extras/2e53c33b91ae57c623d5873d19f6f2fb.webm?t=1757599506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133310/extras/2e53c33b91ae57c623d5873d19f6f2fb.mp4?t=1757599506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>With the voice of Matthew Curtis ('I Am Your Beast')</i></strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Created by Micha\u0142 Marcinkowski ('Soldat', 'Maniac', 'Butcher')</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Inspired by 'Hotline Miami', 'OTXO', 'I Am Your Beast', 'John Wick', 'Pulp Fiction', 'Fear and Loathing In Vegas', 'Goodfellas', 'Cowboy Bebop'</i></strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3133310?t=1757599506","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133310/51107c45c4be9bef3e5a934c5bd9871273cbbe8e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757599506","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133310/9f29c0004f5210b12c90431a368e264c75aa702e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757599506","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133310/9f29c0004f5210b12c90431a368e264c75aa702e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757599506","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game has adult themes like crime and drug use but it is meant as satire and hyperbole. By following the st